	Corpses go through 3 stages as they decay:

Fresh (your dog will eat them, your god will accept them as sacrifice,
	you can eat them and gain intrinsics and food value)

Tainted (neither your dog nor your god will touch them, if you eat
	them you will lose a few hp but still get the food value and
	chance at intrinsics)

Rotten (if you eat them, you will become Sick.  Poison resistance will
	not affect this.  It can be cured by potions of extra healing,
	applying a unicorn horn, or praying (not always effective)).

